CM_ "EV schema 1 draft; DBC/CRC checks only, no BMS codec/receiver/runtime yet. See docs/interfaces/bms-frame.md. Not an OEM calibration or AUTOSAR-certified application.";
CM_ BO_ 387 "Standard 11-bit CAN FD, 48 bytes/DLC 14, logical 20 ms. BRS=0, ESI=0. EV schema 1 is separate from actuator schema 2.";
CM_ SG_ 387 E2ECrc "AUTOSAR P05 DataID 0x1301; CRC LE at bytes 29..30, Counter at 31. Cover 0..28 and 31..47, then implicit DataID low/high.";
CM_ BO_ 643 "Standard 11-bit CAN FD, 64 bytes/DLC 15, logical 10 ms. BRS=0, ESI=0. EV schema 1 is separate from actuator schema 2.";
CM_ SG_ 643 E2ECrc "AUTOSAR P05 DataID 0x1302; CRC LE at bytes 29..30, Counter at 31. Cover 0..28 and 31..63, then implicit DataID low/high.";
CM_ BO_ 644 "Standard 11-bit CAN FD, 48 bytes/DLC 14, logical 20 ms. BRS=0, ESI=0. EV schema 1 is separate from actuator schema 2.";
CM_ SG_ 644 E2ECrc "AUTOSAR P05 DataID 0x1303; CRC LE at bytes 29..30, Counter at 31. Cover 0..28 and 31..47, then implicit DataID low/high.";
CM_ BO_ 645 "Standard 11-bit CAN FD, 64 bytes/DLC 15, logical 100 ms. BRS=0, ESI=0. EV schema 1 is separate from actuator schema 2.";
CM_ SG_ 645 E2ECrc "AUTOSAR P05 DataID 0x1304; CRC LE at bytes 29..30, Counter at 31. Cover 0..28 and 31..63, then implicit DataID low/high.";
CM_ BO_ 403 "Standard 11-bit CAN FD, 48 bytes/DLC 14, logical 20 ms. BRS=0, ESI=0. EV schema 1 is separate from actuator schema 2.";
CM_ SG_ 403 E2ECrc "AUTOSAR P05 DataID 0x1203; CRC LE at bytes 29..30, Counter at 31. Cover 0..28 and 31..47, then implicit DataID low/high.";
CM_ BO_ 404 "Standard 11-bit CAN FD, 64 bytes/DLC 15, logical 10 ms. BRS=0, ESI=0. EV schema 1 is separate from actuator schema 2.";
CM_ SG_ 404 E2ECrc "AUTOSAR P05 DataID 0x1204; CRC LE at bytes 29..30, Counter at 31. Cover 0..28 and 31..63, then implicit DataID low/high.";
CM_ SG_ 387 RequestAction "0 KeepOff / 1 Enable / 2 Shutdown is a request, never an actual contactor state. Invalid uses raw 65535, Validity=0 and zero expiry/parent time.";
CM_ SG_ 387 ExpiresAtNs "Original parent-bounded deadline; valid request requires SourceTimeNs < ExpiresAtNs <= SourceTimeNs+80000000. Rear re-encoding must not renew the request.";
CM_ SG_ 643 PowerState "Actual modeled lifecycle state, not system severity or normal driving permission. Invalid state raw 65535. HV_READY alone cannot authorize Drive.";
CM_ SG_ 643 ConditionBits "Bit0 LV available, bit1 HV interlock closed, bit2 isolation OK, bit3 charger connected, bit4 power fault. Unknown condition bits are zero; ConditionValidity identifies known bits.";
CM_ SG_ 643 InputTimeNs "Oldest physical model input used by this actual snapshot. New publication cannot refresh cached model input.";
CM_ SG_ 643 AcceptedRequestSourceTimeNs "Original accepted Front power request time, CausalSequence is its sequence. NoAcceptedInput requires both correlation fields zero.";
CM_ SG_ 644 InputTimeNs "Oldest local model dependency used for charge/discharge calculation. CausalSequence identifies that model-input batch, not BmsBatteryState CAN publication.";
CM_ SG_ 645 Soc "SOC fraction: valid raw 0..10000, raw 65535 invalid, raw 10001..65534 forbidden. Validity is SOC validity only; other groups have separate flags/times.";
CM_ SG_ 645 Current "Positive discharge / negative charge, 0.1 A, raw -32768 invalid. Wire range is not a physical current limit.";
CM_ SG_ 645 Temperature "0.1 degC, raw -32768 invalid; physical thermal envelope is TBD-13, not the int16 representation range.";
CM_ SG_ 645 ElectricalValid "Voltage and current are one atomic acquisition group. Invalid uses voltage 65535/current -32768 and zero electrical source time.";
CM_ SG_ 403 SourceTimeNs "Preserve original BMS limit generation time/Sequence/Epoch/CausalSequence and InputTimeNs. Only CAN ID, DataID/CRC and transport counter change.";
CM_ SG_ 404 Permission "Valid 0 means inhibit, valid 1 allows only after independent power/limits/torque/session checks. Invalid raw 65535 inhibits. Front owns the decision; Rear preserves its metadata/deadline.";
CM_ SG_ 404 InputTimeNs "Oldest critical input used by the permission decision, including underlying BMS limit/power dependencies; heartbeat time cannot replace it.";
CM_ SG_ 644 ChargePowerLimit "10 W, raw 0..65534; raw 65535 invalid. Validity is charge-limit validity. Valid zero means no allowed charging, not unknown.";
CM_ SG_ 644 DischargePowerLimit "10 W, raw 0..65534, raw 65535 invalid. Independent DischargeLimitValid; no clamping of physical limits into the wire range.";
CM_ SG_ 403 ChargePowerLimit "10 W, raw 0..65534; raw 65535 invalid. Validity is charge-limit validity. Valid zero means no allowed charging, not unknown.";
CM_ SG_ 403 DischargePowerLimit "10 W, raw 0..65534, raw 65535 invalid. Independent DischargeLimitValid; no clamping of physical limits into the wire range.";

